{"title":"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lie on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />.<br />What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is a straight line, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/f/21f88838c038d449fd85db31af21319d97951aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle ABE + m\\angle CBE = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"227\" height=\"16\" />. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110e11991a41eb8886630606052227ea095da9ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$130^{\\circ} + m\\angle CBE = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"190\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/3/f33c905b2ffbaee2708d14f3c3ef79a8f4aede72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle CBE = 180^{\\circ} - 130^{\\circ} = 50^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"240\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>The exterior angle must be the sum of the two non-adjacent angles in the triangle, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/d/5bd37cba2648a438be7c9256337307e04dbd4b1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ} = m\\angle CBE + m\\angle BEC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"211\" height=\"16\" />. This gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7fcf6b9f28fd7c87da1a9eda4b254adfce1d5f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ} = 50^{\\circ} + 60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"118\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/d/46d5c933e6d0cad3c6f22904a5a577afa028f5ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 110}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"75\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC\" title=\"2013 CIMC\">2013 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018055728\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 103/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1656/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 143/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2099/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.403      1 -total\n 49.95%    7.194      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n 41.12%    5.922      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37079:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018055728 and revision id 286376. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}